                        /\ rw_cells asegs m' (R + 16) [C8 (wz (nf - n))])
    (MS (mkR ra sp gp tp t0 t1 t2 (wz R) s1 a0 a1 a2 a3 (wz n) (wz nf) a6 a7 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 t3 t4 t5 t6)
